  "readmeFile": "docs\\README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "3.0.0: Major release for target framework alignment. Supported target frameworks are net8.0, net9.0, and net10.0. Support for .NET 6 has been removed; upgrade consuming projects to a supported framework. Breaking (dynamic-mode MemoryStreamSlim): after Dispose, Length and Position getters/setters and capacity APIs (Capacity, CapacityLong) throw ObjectDisposedException where aligned with BCL MemoryStream; code that relied on non-throwing reads of last values after dispose must change—see ReleaseNotes.md. Prior 2.x highlights included .NET 9 support, MemoryStreamSlim Int64 capacity, compression stream helpers (2.0.0), and a race-condition fix (2.0.1).",
